# pyenv
#   For a library or package, you might want to share your .python-version.
#   For an app, you probably want to ignore it.
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if used with a pyproject.toml, you might ignore it.
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similarly, in case of a library, you might want to include poetry.lock in version control.
#Poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, it is generally recommended to include pdm.lock in version control.
#pdm.lock

